  <Id>k__BackingField: racing_game
  <SceneBuildIndex>k__BackingField: 5
  <GameType>k__BackingField: 3
  <GameDuration>k__BackingField: -1
  <IsTimeLimited>k__BackingField: 0
  <StartDelay>k__BackingField: 5
  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: Race of Death
  <Description>k__BackingField: <line-height=70%> <align="center"><size=140%><b>HOW
    TO PLAY</b></size></align><br> <b>1. The Field:</b> Players stand on a grid of
    numbered <color=#00FFFF>Mines Plates</color>.  <br><b>2. The Turn:</b> Players
    take turns one by one. On your turn, you must choose and activate a single plate.
    <br><br><b>3. The Outcome:</b> <br>If the plate is <b><color=#00FF00>Safe</color></b>,
    you stay in the game and the next player takes their turn.       <br><br>If the
    plate is a <b><color=#FF0000>Mine</color></b>, you are eliminated from the round. 
    <br><br><b>4. Winning:</b> The game continues until only one player is left.
    The <b><color=#FFFF00>Last One Standing</color></b> wins the match. </line-height>
